OL,3,GNEWSASchool programme tackles online
OL,4,Aabuse in football
OL,5,
OL,6,FNine schools will take part in a
OL,7,F12-week programme aimed at tackling
OL,8,Fonline abuse and discrimination in
OL,9,Ffootball.
OL,11,FNorthampton Town Community Trust is
OL,12,Frunning Cobblers Play Fair with support
OL,13,Ffrom the Premier League and the
OL,14,FProfessional Footballers' Association
OL,15,FPlayers' Fund.
OL,17,FFigures released by the English
OL,18,FFootball League last year showed online
OL,19,Fabuse directed at its players during
OL,20,Fthe 2024-25 season had doubled over two
OL,21,Fseasons.
